egral, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}\\frac{{e}^{3/x}}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{3}(1-{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{e}^{3a}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}(1-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14047719/state.json" "file_sha256" "4fa62d5d11bdb4b96bb6baef0f59e1f6f727ea73774ec93f80097f7a913ac704" "basis" 1700 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14047719/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-351528" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14047719/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "9a7daed03fc8c3c14b6f0511b41ff3700c3e15cf58a8b79ca63f477ad77006bf" "basis" 1700 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14047719/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-351528" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14047719/state.json" "file_sha256" "4fa62d5d11bdb4b96bb6baef0f59e1f6f727ea73774ec93f80097f7a913ac704" "basis" 1700 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14047719/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-346618" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}{x}^{2}\\cdot {5}^{{x}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14067475/state.json" "file_sha256" "837a37d862e7945c16c0ca61686d05e89343f8e6c6ab8dd454f15142f77b5031" "basis" 2315 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14067475/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-346618" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we substitute $u={x}^{3}.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=3{x}^{2}\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{3}\\text{d}u={x}^{2}\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSince $u\\to -\\infty $ when $x\\to -\\infty ,$ the table for the limits of integration using the rule $u={x}^{3}$ is as follows:\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $-\\infty $ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $-\\infty $ |\n\nSo, the integral in terms of the new variable $u$ is\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}{x}^{2}\\cdot {5}^{{x}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}{5}^{u}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nNow, we proceed by setting the lower bound equal to some parameter $a,$ integrating as usual, and then taking the limit as $a\\to -\\infty .$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}{x}^{2}\\cdot {5}^{{x}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{3}{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{\\int }_{a}^{0}{5}^{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{[\\frac{{5}^{u}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}]}_{a}^{0} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }[{5}^{u}]_{a}^{0} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }(1-{5}^{a}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(1-{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{5}^{a})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, recall the end behavior of the function $y={5}^{a},$ shown in the graph below:\n\n- ${lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{5}^{a}=0$\n\n- ${lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{5}^{a}=\\infty $\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14067475/assets/c0c7699b036ebd8779cd6c3d3143cdcca6312834ee731e144e38488124164f43.png)\n\nUsing this to evaluate our integral, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}{x}^{2}\\cdot {5}^{{x}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(1-{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{5}^{a}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(1-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14067475/state.json" "file_sha256" "837a37d862e7945c16c0ca61686d05e89343f8e6c6ab8dd454f15142f77b5031" "basis" 2315 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14067475/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-346618" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14067475/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bf4385f1489a1e72426f4cbc67a8f202e69f3ca1ea8ac7b40fc50a2a828cb418" "basis" 2315 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14067475/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-346618" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14067475/state.json" "file_sha256" "837a37d862e7945c16c0ca61686d05e89343f8e6c6ab8dd454f15142f77b5031" "basis" 2315 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14067475/edb-import/verification.json"}] "sources" [{"question" "q-346618" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{-\\infty }^{0}{x}^{2}\\cdot {5}^{{x}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-worke